<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-19T22:20:49.950Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:20:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli tanks have crossed the Yellow Line into central Gaza and launched a ground operation, while an airstrike on Nasser Hospital killed six Palestinians. In the West Bank, Israeli settlers shot a 72‑year-old Palestinian woman near a new outpost and the IDF mistakenly demolished a Palestinian home in violation of a Supreme Court order. Israel delayed building contracts for a West Bank settlement after sanctions on construction firms and used a video of swimming in Gaza to downplay civilian hardships. The International Court of Justice ruling that Myanmar committed genocide against the Rohingya is being cited as potentially relevant to Israel's genocide defence. The conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c804wzp20ddvo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/18/israeli-military-launches-new-operation-on-central-gaza-despite-ceasefire&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/19/palestinians-in-gaza-face-new-displacement-after-israeli-army-operation?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/18/israel-construction-contracts-e1-west-bank-settlement-uk-sanctions&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/live/2026/11/19/world/myanmar-icj-ruling-genocide&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/world/asia/icj-myanmar-gaza.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNQ3NpZEp2dmlxVFQ0UHdkQ0hqMW1YQ0RVaTBxa09KN3hiOXZMbVJaM3ptRkFTTHQ4d1NpWkNQVU9PWHRDQW12alB1a0tFd3cwQnlMUXNSWDZwZ3R1bFl4RFVoZHppZW